  " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(-30px)"></h1><h2 class="font-normal md:my-3 leading-8 md:leading-[3.1rem] text-[28px] md:text-5xl md:mt-1" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)">Meet the leadership behind Calsoft’s<br/> AI and digital engineering outcomes.</h2><p class="!text-base md:!text-lg leading-6 font-light max-w-[90%] md:max-w-[600px]  mt-4 text-lg leading-8 max-w-[90%] md:w-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)">Have an AI, cloud, data, product engineering, testing, or modernization initiative? Connect with the right Calsoft expert to explore your next step.</p><div class="flex lg:flex-row flex-col gap-x-6 gap-y-4"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="items-center border-2 border-[#3F3D9B] border-l-0 rounded-2xl p-0 max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-white my-12 hidden md:flex relative justify-end"><div class="absolute -left-[4rem] h-full rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-[#F2F0F5]"><img alt="Person" loading="lazy" width="387" height="398" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Anupam.44c0f6e1.webp"/><div class="absolute inset-0 h-full rounded-full border-8 border-[#3F3D9B]" style="clip-path:polygon(0% 0%, 50% 0%, 50% 100%, 0% 100%)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 h-full rounded-full border-2 border-[#3F3D9B]" style="clip-path:polygon(50% 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 50% 100%)"></div></div><div class="w-5/6 my-4 -ml-16 self-end" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-black">Dr. Anupam Bhide</h2><p class="text-base text-gray-800 mb-3">Founder &amp; CEO</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-700 max-w-xl">Our success has always come from keeping customers at the heart of engineering. We’re here to solve real-world challenges with scalable, intelligent, and secure technology solutions that evolve with our clients’ ambitions.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center md:hidden my-10 gap-3"><img alt="anupam bhide" loading="lazy" width="387" height="398" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="border-2 border-[#3F3D9B] size-20 rounded-full bg-[#E0E0E0]" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Anupam.44c0f6e1.webp"/><div class="text-center"><p class="text-xl font-semibold">Dr. Anupam Bhide</p><p class="text-xl font-medium">Founder &amp; CEO</p></div><p class="mx-4 text-center">Our success has always come from keeping customers at the heart of engineering. We’re here to solve real-world challenges with scalable, intelligent, and secure technology solutions that evolve with our clients’ ambitions.</p></div><div class="my-10 pb-12 space-y-20 container"><div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-5 max-w-3xl mx-auto" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#2E3092_25%,#ED1C24_88%)] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Leadership team</p><p class="text-center">Calsoft’s leadership team brings decades of experience and a technology-first vision to guide our customers’ success</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5"><div class="manrope relative group rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md my-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><img alt="Dr. Anupam Bhide" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[350px] object-cover transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0 border-gray-300 border" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Anupam.44c0f6e1.webp"/><div class="h-[80px] absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#2E3092]/90 text-white px-3 py-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0"><p class="text-lg font-semibold">Dr. Anupam Bhide</p><p class="text-xs">Founder &amp; CEO</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2E3092] text-white opacity-0 translate-y-5 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center items-left p-4 text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium">Dr. Anupam Bhide</p><p class="text-sm italic">Founder &amp; CEO</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Dr. Anupam Bhide is the founder and CEO of Calsoft Inc. With more than 22 years of experience in the technology industry, he is widely respected for his integrity, innovative mindset, and dynamism. His visionary leadership has played a key role in establishing Calsoft Inc.</p></div></div><div class="manrope relative group rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md my-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><img alt="Sharmila Bhide" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[350px] object-cover transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0 border-gray-300 border" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Sharmila.f111f45b.webp"/><div class="h-[80px] absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#2E3092]/90 text-white px-3 py-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0"><p class="text-lg font-semibold">Sharmila Bhide</p><p class="text-xs">Co-founder, CFO &amp; Chief Mentor</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2E3092] text-white opacity-0 translate-y-5 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center items-left p-4 text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium">Sharmila Bhide</p><p class="text-sm italic">Co-founder, CFO &amp; Chief Mentor</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Sharmila Bhide is the co-founder and CFO of Calsoft Inc. Sharmila is responsible for shaping all aspects of the company’s business strategies and spearheading financial planning and strategy initiatives.</p></div></div><div class="manrope relative group rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md my-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><img alt="Parag Kulkarni" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[350px] object-cover transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0 border-gray-300 border" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Parag.d39108e1.webp"/><div class="h-[80px] absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#2E3092]/90 text-white px-3 py-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0"><p class="text-lg font-semibold">Parag Kulkarni</p><p class="text-xs">COO</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2E3092] text-white opacity-0 translate-y-5 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center items-left p-4 text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium">Parag Kulkarni</p><p class="text-sm italic">COO</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Parag Kulkarni is chief operations officer at Calsoft. Parag is an industry veteran, bringing more than 30 years of experience designing and developing complex technology products. Parag drives the technology roadmap at Calsoft to improve the overall quality of delivery processes.</p></div></div><div class="manrope relative group rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md my-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><img alt="Anshul Bhide" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[350px] object-cover transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0 border-gray-300 border" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Anshul.31e57bde.webp"/><div class="h-[80px] absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#2E3092]/90 text-white px-3 py-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0"><p class="text-lg font-semibold">Anshul Bhide</p><p class="text-xs">Whole Time Director &amp; AI/ML Practice Head</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2E3092] text-white opacity-0 translate-y-5 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center items-left p-4 text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium">Anshul Bhide</p><p class="text-sm italic">Whole Time Director &amp; AI/ML Practice Head</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Anshul is an Executive Director and heads overall strategy &amp; marketing for Calsoft while leading the AI/ML practice at Calsoft. He has over a decade of experience in strategy, venture capital, &amp; investing and tech operations.</p></div></div><div class="manrope relative group rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md my-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><img alt="Uday Ketkar" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[350px] object-cover transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0 border-gray-300 border" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Uday.b83e25df.webp"/><div class="h-[80px] absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#2E3092]/90 text-white px-3 py-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0"><p class="text-lg font-semibold">Uday Ketkar</p><p class="text-xs">Associate Chief Operations Officer</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2E3092] text-white opacity-0 translate-y-5 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center items-left p-4 text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium">Uday Ketkar</p><p class="text-sm italic">Associate Chief Operations Officer</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Uday Ketkar is the Associate Chief Operations Officer at Calsoft Inc., where he oversees overall operations, including IT, TA &amp; RMG, Admin, HR, and Engineering.</p></div></div><div class="manrope relative group rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md my-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><img alt="Pradipta Mitra " loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[350px] object-cover transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0 border-gray-300 border" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Pradipta.83117558.webp"/><div class="h-[80px] absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#2E3092]/90 text-white px-3 py-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0"><p class="text-lg font-semibold">Pradipta Mitra </p><p class="text-xs">Senior VP - Sales</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2E3092] text-white opacity-0 translate-y-5 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center items-left p-4 text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium">Pradipta Mitra </p><p class="text-sm italic">Senior VP - Sales</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Pradipta brings over 30 years of experience in the Hi-Tech industry, leading initiatives across storage, compute, software, and platform product companies in the US, UK, and India.</p></div></div><div class="manrope relative group rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md my-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><img alt="Somenath Nag" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[350px] object-cover transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0 border-gray-300 border" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Somenath.d1c9da3b.webp"/><div class="h-[80px] absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#2E3092]/90 text-white px-3 py-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0"><p class="text-lg font-semibold">Somenath Nag</p><p class="text-xs">Sr. Vice President</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2E3092] text-white opacity-0 translate-y-5 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center items-left p-4 text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium">Somenath Nag</p><p class="text-sm italic">Sr. Vice President</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Somenath Nag is a seasoned professional with nearly 30 years of industry experience. At Calsoft, he drives business growth in Telecom, Networking, and IoT domains, managing large strategic accounts.</p></div></div><div class="manrope relative group rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md my-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><img alt="Vipin Shankar" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-[400px] md:h-[350px] object-cover transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0 border-gray-300 border" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/Vipin.285011c2.webp"/><div class="h-[80px] absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#2E3092]/90 text-white px-3 py-2 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:opacity-0"><p class="text-lg font-semibold">Vipin Shankar</p><p class="text-xs">Senior Vice President Technology&amp; Head of Presales</p></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2E3092] text-white opacity-0 translate-y-5 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500 ease-out flex flex-col justify-center items-left p-4 text-left"><p class="text-lg font-medium">Vipin Shankar</p><p class="text-sm italic">Senior Vice President Technology&amp; Head of Presales</p><p class="text-xs mt-2">Vipin Shankar leads the Technology Office and Presales at Calsoft, bringing over 25 years of experience setting up engineering operations and building teams to develop innovative products, services, and solutions and driving the technology roadmap.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] "><div class="w-full h-full bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,_rgba(0,0,0,1)_0%,_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)_50%,_rgba(0,0,0,0)_100%)] absolute z-10"></div><img alt="Banner" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/know_more.88c511e2.png"/><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-center justify-start md:justify-start min-h-[220px] w-full h-full p-6 md:p-12"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center items-start"><h2 class="text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold mb-2" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)">To know more</h2><p class="text-white/80 te